; Top Payees fixture (Insights Box 11).
;
; Asked for over 2025-01-01 .. 2025-12-31, the dashboard splits the year at
; 2025-06-30: previous = Jan–Jun, current = Jul–Dec. Expected current-period
; ranking with the default tax exclusion:
;
;   Wells Fargo    $880.00  prev $900.00   mortgage INTEREST is an expense posting
;   Costco         $700.00  prev $500.00   $800 of purchases less a $100 refund
;   Whole Foods    $400.00  prev $150.00   the cashback leg does not hide it
;   Hardware Store  $75.00  new            costs booked outside expenses:, by type
;   Cafe Roma       $60.00  new
;
; Never listed: Chase (card payments move money between accounts and have no
; expense leg), Acme Corp (a paycheck; its withholding is not spending at the
; employer) and IRS (taxes are excluded by default; with `exclude=` it tops the
; list at $2,500.00).

account assets:checking               ; type: C
account liabilities:card              ; type: L
account liabilities:mortgage          ; type: L
account equity:opening                ; type: E
account income:salary                 ; type: R
account income:rewards                ; type: R
account expenses                      ; type: X
account expenses:groceries
account expenses:shopping
account expenses:insurance:health
account expenses:interest:mortgage
account expenses:taxes:federal
account household:supplies            ; type: X

